<title>UK: EBRD says rumours of security alert unfounded.</title>
<headline>EBRD says rumours of security alert unfounded.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) said rumours of a security alert at its London headquarters were unfounded.</p>
<p>A bank spokesman, contacted by Reuters about the rumours, said the EBRD was operating normally.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
